WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.980
Hm... this layout you came up with
has really bad feng shui.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Counter
Hall

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.260
Really?

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:14.570
The flow of chi energy is coming from this direction,
so you shouldn't block it off.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.290
This is difficult...

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.630
No worries! Just let me take 
care of the adjustments.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:20.710
But...

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:25.170
The family I'm staying with works in the carpentry biz,
so I can bring any tools we need.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.580
You're trying to take on too 
much by yourself, Chiya.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:29.250
You guys...

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.670
One of the manager's duties
is assigning work to other people.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.670
I feel blessed to have such wonderful
employees working for me!

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.350
When did we become employees?!

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.850
Director!

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.380
Class C got dibs on collaborating
with that one grape juice shop!

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:51.890
What?!

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:54.110
We were really hoping to serve their juice...

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:57.330
All the other classes are working 
with popular shops, too.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:59.900
We gotta do something or our 
cafe will be super dull!

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:02.920
We'll just have to bet everything 
on our interior design.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:07.080
Oh! What if we borrowed some furnishings
from the rich girl school?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.890
Nice idea, Cocoa!

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:13.460
All right! This is a job for our representative,
the Class Prez! Go get some stuff for us!

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:16.630
That's the school I was dying 
to get into, but failed...

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:18.260
Prez?

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.540
Okay then, just let the manager
and the supervisor handle it!

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:21.860
"Supervisor"?

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.080
Wait!

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.440
I've heard if you don't tread 
carefully at that school,

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.900
you'll end up with a bad case 
of Salutations Syndrome!

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:30.380
Any trouble and we'll give 
'em the ol' stank eye!

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:31.750
That'll teach 'em!

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:33.150
Don't get too crazy.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.880
We'll go and avenge your failure, Prez!

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:36.500
Good luck.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:38.670
Show them what our school is really made of!

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:40.410
What happened to borrowing stuff?

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:46.710
And so...

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:49.790
That's how we ended up at 
Rize and Syaro's school!

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:52.800
And that's all the stuff you borrowed?

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.960
Yes. These are our spoils of war
that we won fair and square.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.710
Now we can march into class
and make a triumphant return!

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:00.800
I'm sure all our employees will be overjoyed.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.670
Sounds like a really fun class to be in.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:07.880
So, why are you still wearing those uniforms?

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.630
Because we want to show them to everybody!

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.690
I'm sure all our employees will be shocked.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:14.940
Huh? Are you going back to school right now?

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:18.170
Yeah, we still have prep for 
the Culture Festival to do!

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.950
Oh, right. Please do your best.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.330
Salutations!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:27.000
S-salutations... bye.

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.790
Spin around with a twirl, hey, dance dance

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.990
In the heavenly cafeteria, dance dance

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:38.540
Where is the door? (Over here!)

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:42.290
Take a hop into the cup (Leap right in!)

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:45.440
Big puffy clouds float through the sky

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:48.750
They actually taste sweet, 
for real (Just kidding!)

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.830
If we fly through the sky 
in tea cups and coffee cups

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:55.050
We can go anywhere together

00:02:55.050 --> 00:03:01.120
Wanting to be a dreamer forever 
(More impossible than possible)

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:07.130
Think about how exciting tomorrow 
will be (So many flavors to try!)

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:09.790
Cinnamon instead of sugar

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.540
If that becomes a preference, 
it might be time for evolution

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.960
Going to a new place (Were you invited?)

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:20.000
If you get invited there, 
let's take the plunge and fly

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.000
(C'mon ride in the tea cup 
and soar through the sky)

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.210
(C'mon ride in the coffee cup, yeah yeah)

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:28.960
Spin around with a twirl, hey, 
dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:32.210
In the heavenly cafeteria, 
dance dance (Dance dance)

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:35.940
Where is the door? It's inside of the cup

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:38.320
An illusion? Or reality? Which?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:41.830
It doesn't really matter 
either way (Good point)

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:44.830
A dollop of whip cream on 
your head (Fluff fluff)

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:51.000
Okay, just dance (The future) it'll 
definitely be fun (So let's fly!)

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:54.380
Flying through the sky in 
tea cups and coffee cups

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.630
We can go anywhere together!

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.130
Cocoa and Chiya are late.

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:04.290
Maybe they got beaten...

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:06.330
No way, not those two.

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:07.500
Hey, guys!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.630
Sorry to keep you!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:10.270
Sounds like they're back.

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.420
Salutations!

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.270
They've been brainwashed!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:18.790
We got along great with the rich girls
from the Garment Club and they let us wear these.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.080
And the furnishings?

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:20.920
No worries!

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:24.580
We competed against a bunch of their clubs
and brought back a ton of stuff!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:25.660
"Competed"?

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:29.000
It was a real whirlwind adventure!

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.880
You did all of that just for our class...?

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:33.960
Not sure that's something to cry over.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:34.870
First up...

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.580
These masks that we won 
from the Blow-dart Club!

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.880
I have no idea what they 
are, but they look cool!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:44.540
We also beat the principal and won the right
to borrow this sculpture!

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:47.540
That's definitely going 
to draw some attention!

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.460
So this is a taste of 
the rich girl life, huh?

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.670
Praise be our goddesses!

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:54.960
Hallelujah!

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:57.460
We're going to decorate with this...?

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.330
I wonder if Rize and Syaro
will be surprised to see all this.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:05.460
Those two are from the 
rich girl school, right?

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:05.880
Yeah!

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.130
They're our good friends.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:10.660
What can you tell us about them?

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:11.960
Well...

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:16.960
Rize has her very own gun 
and she specializes in CQC!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.290
Sounds like bad news.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:23.750
And Syaro goes totally bonkers
whenever she drinks caffeine!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.810
Some total monsters are coming!

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:29.960
We have to play our cards right or else
it might be the end of our days!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:37.880
Chiya!

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.960
Can you come test this dish we cooked up?

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:43.000
Sure!

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:49.700
I think the flavor could be a little richer.

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:52.750
Okay. Richer it is!

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:57.000
Chiya's doing a better job of leading the class
than the Class President is!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.210
It's nice having someone so reliable around.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.580
I know, right?

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:03.130
That's my best friend for you! I'm so proud!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.250
How nice.

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:09.000
I wonder if being around Cocoa
ever turns Chiya into a bumbling mess.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.240
What does that mean?!

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:12.170
I'm joking!

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:15.460
I thought I just heard somebody say
I'm like a real manager...

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.210
Nobody said that!

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:19.490
Though if I had to describe you,
I'd say you're the overboss of our class!

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:20.540
The overboss?

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:22.710
That's wonderful!

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.250
You're okay with that...?

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.460
What position does Cocoa get?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.710
Hm, good question.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.780
Excite! Excite! Excite!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.750
Good girl, good girl.

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.330
She's the little sister of our class!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:38.660
Nuh-uh! I already have a little sister of my own
named Chino, you know!

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.750
Jeez!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.210
You were so cute earlier, Cocoa.

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:51.330
I see you've totally gotten past that pressure
you were feeling before.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:56.330
Keep this up and you'll make
a wonderful manager for Ama Usa An!

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:01.040
You're no slouch yourself, Cocoa!

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:05.580
After all, things are always fun
because you're around!

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:07.580
Cocoa.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:09.330
Chiya.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:15.500
Okay! Let's do our best 
with the remaining prep!

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:17.700
Right!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:19.910
Whoo!

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:23.920
Bunnisode 4:
A Potential Everyday Life

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.250
Tomorrow is finally the big day!

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:31.250
Yes! All the prep is done!

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.800
It really feels like our class 
has come together as one!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.140
Must be fun.

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:39.850
Why are you getting all pouty?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.600
Huh? Was I making that kind of face?!

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.580
You've been acting weird, too, Syaro.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.200
N-no, I have not!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.880
Miss Aoyama, what's your 
read on the situation?

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:57.280
The stark differences in their school lives are making
those two feel a mix of jealousy and loneliness.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.250
Not true!

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.370
Wh-what's your deal?

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:06.040
Here. It's an invitation 
to our Culture Festival!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.740
I-I'm excited to check it out.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:14.500
Actually, the reason we've been working so hard
on this event was because we wanted you all to enjoy it.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:16.920
Thank you.

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:19.580
And finally...

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:21.880
one for Chino!

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:26.830
Thanks so much!

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.880
Brace yourselves!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:33.460
Because you're invited...

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.150
...to our beer hall!

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:36.040
Huh?!

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:03.520
So this is Cocoa's high school...

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:07.380
Wow, it's got a totally different 
vibe from our school.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.380
Yeah, everyone's so pumped!

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:11.960
Look at all the tents and food stalls.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:12.750
Let's go!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.610
Wait up!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.920
Hey! Don't cut too loose out there!

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:21.990
Senpai! Let's go enjoy ourselves, too!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.500
Wow, they really spared no expense!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.500
Check us out!

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.670
Foam mustaches!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.380
HELLO, UNDERAGED MUCH?!

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:39.500
Calm down, it's apple juice!

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:41.830
Huh? Oh, that's a relief.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.960
It's just served to look like beer.

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:45.920
They were selling it over there!

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:48.210
Look, they have a Tippy!

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.890
CHINO HAS A MUSTACHE!

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:15.710
Wait! Hold on, Chino! It's me!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.470
I said we were going to 
make Tippy hats, remember?!

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:18.470
This voice...

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:27.000
Cocoa! That's not a hat! 
It's a full-on head mask!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.000
You look like a monster!

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:32.440
Let me guide all of you to our class!

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.350
You told us you were 
doing a beer hall, right?

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.500
It's just like Rabbit 
House is during bar hours!

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:39.830
Welcome!

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:40.960
Please check us out!

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:48.460
This is the place!

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.460
Heads up! We've got 5 new customers!

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:56.880
This is so good!

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:57.920
Right away!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:58.960
Welcome!

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.460
Cheers!

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:06.360
It's way busier than Rabbit House!

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.850
Welcome!

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:10.270
I'm Chiya, the owner.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.420
We're glad to be here!

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:15.360
So the theme is Oktoberfest?

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.130
Yes!

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:18.570
"Oktoberfest"?

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.170
It's just a joke, please 
enjoy our faux beer festival!

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:22.830
Okay!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:26.670
We already have a famous author
wanting to become a regular.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:30.960
The hustle and bustle of this Culture Festival
is really motivating me to write!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.460
She's actually working!

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.540
And her editor even came to cheer her on.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:38.710
The deadline is tomorrow! Keep it up, Sensei!

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.290
Jeez, talk about crunch time!

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.200
Is she getting drunk on that juice or what?

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.380
She's the type who gets 
drunk on the atmosphere.

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:47.710
Excuse me, little miss!

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:52.490
If my tarot reading is right, you must be Chino,
the daughter of the family Cocoa stays with.

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:55.250
Th-thank you for looking after 
my dimwitted big sister!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.250
Did you hear that?! She said "big sister"!

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:00.720
No comment on the "dimwitted" part?

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.330
I guess that doesn't bother her.

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:08.270
What a relief. They seem way more normal
than we expected.

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:10.170
Security alert aborted, everyone!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.000
What's all that about?

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:18.000
I don't know, but you should never put your guard down
when the enemy's true nature is still unclear!

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:20.080
Y-yes, sir!

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:20.790
Sir!

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:22.630
She just became their sergeant!

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:24.130
Here you are!

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.250
How impressive! Aren't those heavy?

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.380
Doing carpentry work gave me some muscles.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.210
I'm sure you could carry them too, Senpai!

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:37.040
You do seem like a tough customer, Rize.
Care for an arm wrestling match with Kano?

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:40.710
Okay, are you both good?

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.630
I'm ready to start whenever.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:44.290
I'm not gonna lose.

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:45.000
Bring it!

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.040
Ready?

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:46.960
Go!

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:55.040
I won!

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:09.880
Rize! Syaro! They said we 
can try on the outfits!

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:11.930
Senpai!

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:13.580
Will you try them on with me?!

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:15.500
U-uh, I think I'll pass.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:21.580
Great! You should have no problem
filling in for us like that.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.360
Huh?

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:25.280
The beer hall ended up overlapping
with our club events!

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:26.730
We'll be back soon!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:28.380
So we're stand-ins?!

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.540
There was a little bit 
of a schedule mishap...

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.830
Yeah, it's just the kind 
of prank our class plays...

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.130
You're both blue in the face.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:37.670
And trembling really bad.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.380
No sweat! I'm off to take some orders!

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.880
We were born ready for this!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.500
Girls!

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.960
Thank you so much!

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:50.880
The Chimame Corps is also ready to deploy!

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.920
This pretzel is so yummy...

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:56.420
Either help or eat! Just pick one!

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:59.920
Sitting for too long will 
make my legs go numb, so...

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:02.540
I'm starting to come down 
off my high, anyways.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:05.360
I can't tell who's a customer
and who's a waitress anymore!

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:08.330
Is anybody out pulling in new customers?

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:10.290
Oh crap, I forgot!

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:11.080
Huh?

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:14.380
Where did my Tippy mask get off to...?

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.210
Over there!

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.040
Tippy on Tippy?!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.960
Then the person inside must be...!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.840
We put it on Chino's head as a joke
and then she got real popular!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.500
But everybody ran away 
when I was wearing it...

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.460
Bye-bye!

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:36.560
Do you mind if we go out 
advertising like this?

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.460
But we can't ask you to do all that work...

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:44.270
It's okay. I completely understand
why you want to make this cafe a big success.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.750
Chino...!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.790
So please, let me do it!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.530
I'll strut my stuff as the 
granddaughter of a real cafe!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.210
Madam Chino!

00:14:56.460 --> 00:15:00.790
Excuse me! Can someone please take the order
from the table on the far side?

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:05.080
Thank you for waiting!
Here's your mysterious foamy juice.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.790
Two more orders of juice are ready!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:08.830
Here are the 8 orders of juice you asked for!

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:12.410
Hall staff, time to swap out!

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:13.750
We can handle the rest!

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:17.000
Thank you. You've done enough.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.790
Okay! Let's hurry and go meet 
up with Chino and the oth-

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.040
Wait just a moment!

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:24.290
Since you did us a big favor,

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:27.580
would you be interested
in trying on our school's uniform?

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.040
Huh?!

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.490
We don't want to impose!

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:34.920
In exchange, I want you to let me try on the uniform
from your fancy school sometime!

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:37.000
That's what you actually 
care about, huh, Prez?

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.380
So adorable!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.880
May I take your picture?

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:46.750
Go ahead.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.290
And please consider visiting Rabbit House.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.420
She's way more assertive than usual.

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:56.390
I guess having that mask 
on makes her less shy.

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:59.810
Or maybe she's just really 
fitting in at this school?

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:03.130
Yeah, this school is just 
as fun as the other one.

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:17.080
You know, I feel reassured knowing
that Chiya and Cocoa have such great friends here.

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:18.250
Same here.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.080
Rize! Syaro!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:25.330
So, what area do you think 
we should check out first?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:28.880
Let's do some reconnaissance 
on the other classes!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.500
This is so tasty...

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.120
This is paradise...

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.080
You two are really enjoying yourselves.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:03.080
What happened to doing recon?

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:08.070
I bet it would be a huge hassle
if we had to be in the same class as them.

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:10.000
Classmates, eh?

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.000
Although, I'm actually a 
year ahead of you guys...

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:20.010
But if your birthday was just a month or so later,
then we would have been in the same year!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:22.040
It doesn't make any real difference!

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:23.670
Oh yeah?

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:27.210
So it doesn't make a difference?

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.630
In that case, you should quit referring
to me as Rize the "Senpai"!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:33.880
Th-then, Rize my classmate?

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:37.920
Or maybe something more friendly...

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:41.790
Rize... my bestie?

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:45.460
Something more personal than that?!

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:50.170
My... my... my....

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.290
Don't push yourself!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.380
Hey, I found our high school crew!

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:10.580
They blended in so well I 
didn't even recognize them.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.170
Come visit the Photography Club!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.570
And treasure today's memories with a photo!

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:16.960
Chino?

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:20.290
Please come take a picture with your friends
and make this an unforgettable experience!

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:24.040
Photos are the best way of capturing fun
memories to last a lifetime!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.790
As the president of the Photography Club
I'm more than happy to help!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.420
Do you have a moment?
These wonderful days of...

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.580
Oh, yes!

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:41.490
Putting that Tippy mask on made you
super confident, huh, Chino?

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:43.500
I was just drunk on the beer.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.040
But that was juice!

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:49.000
Chino?

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:50.830
What's wrong?

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:58.670
I really enjoyed the atmosphere
of that Culture Festival.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:03.210
There were a lot people and many thrills.

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:06.540
It convinced me that school 
is a fun place to be.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.500
So you wanna be with Cocoa, huh?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.050
Are you head over heels for her or what?

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:17.580
Just kidding!

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.210
But are you sure you'll be 
okay on your own, Chino?

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:22.430
O-of course I will.

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:23.880
Really?

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:25.920
I'm not a little kid, you know.

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:30.540
I've made up my mind.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:37.170
That sure was a blast, huh, Senpai?

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:40.530
I was happy to see Cocoa and Chiya
having such a good time.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:42.420
Oh, that reminds me.

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:47.330
What's in this envelope Chino gave us?

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:02.090
The best ever!!
Good job, y'all

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:06.710
Today seriously felt like one long dream.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:09.960
I'm still floating on cloud nine.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:13.710
Oh yeah!

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:19.100
Chino gave us something to commemorate today!

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:20.460
Let's see what it is.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.470
We've all got such big smiles.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:33.880
I guess this is what it would have been like
if we were all at the same school.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:38.200
Hey! Director and vice-director!

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.510
It's time to start the after party!

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:41.460
Okay!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.830
We'll go put the cleaning 
supplies away right now!

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:59.380
We are friends forever!

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:01.230
Friends! Okay! Friends!

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:04.570
We'll make it happen! There's 
no problem since it's all okay!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:08.590
"There are mysterious things in this world"

00:21:08.590 --> 00:21:12.470
An inviting message from 
outside the familiar window

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:16.420
Would you like to explore different places?

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:20.220
Yeah, yeah, an adventure is 
needed every now and then

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:24.110
And eventually on some street corner far away

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:28.180
We'll get a craving to drink the usual coffee

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:34.130
There are many things to realize 
if you just take a step back!

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:37.630
Of course...

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:41.440
Right now being together is 
best, together forever is best

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:45.320
Even amidst the changing seasons

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:49.330
I want to keep these feelings, 
I want to treasure everyone

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:53.350
I'm glad to have a place that I love

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:57.210
Right now being together is best, 
that's right, together is best

00:21:57.210 --> 00:22:00.830
Even if you go somewhere 
else, be sure to come back

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:02.960
I think that feeling is understood

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:08.250
Because, after all, I got 
to see everyone today

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:14.670
Seeing them whenever I want 
means... we're friends!

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:18.670
We are friends forever!

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:20.230
Friends! Okay! Friends!

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:24.420
We'll make it happen! There's 
no problem since it's okay!

00:22:32.630 --> 00:22:35.880
Hey, Cocoa, could you lend me that book ab-?

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:49.750
I wonder how it will look...

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:10.920
I'll have to decide what 
color cardigan I want.

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:17.800
Chino!

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:21.670
Ouch! Please let go of me, Cocoa!

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:23.170
I'm never letting go of you again!

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:25.210
You can't be serious!

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:28.960
Why do you have that?

00:23:28.960 --> 00:23:31.330
Cocoa gave it to me
as a souvenir from the Culture Festival.

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:34.040
I actually wanted to try wearing it myself!

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:35.970
Bunnisode 5: She is a Fierce 
Whirlwind, She is a Carefree Breeze

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:35.670
You'd just be making yourself bigger.
